<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφευρ-ίσκω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ-</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφευρήσω</span>: aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηῦρον</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφεῦ</span>-; 
			Aeol.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεύρ[οι]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηύρηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1093
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				1.17
			</span></i>, etc.:— <i>find</i> or <i>discover, find
				anywhere</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ που ἐφεύροι ἠῑόνας λιμένας τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.439
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				417
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				266a
			</span></i>: usu. c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃν δ᾽ αὐ . . βοόωντα ἐφεύροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.198
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαινυμένους δ᾽ εὐ πάντας ἐφεύρομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.452
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήν γ᾽ ἀλλύουσαν ἐφεύρομεν
				ἀγλαὸν ἱστόν</span> we <i>discovered</i> her undoing
			it, <i><span class="en">
				24.145
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1093
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				307c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπρι . . σε πικροτάταν
			ἐπεύροι</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
			</span></i> l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ἐπευρεθῇ πρήσσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.109
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλέπτων ὅταν τις . . ἐφευρεθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					930
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῶν ἐφευρίσκῃ</span>
				(2sg.) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OC</u>
				928
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηύρημαι κακός</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OT</u>
				1421
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				281
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειλὸς ὤν ἐφηυρέθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					319
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>discover besides</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθ᾽ εὑρ.</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.158
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ἀρχαίαις τέσσαρας χορδάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					3.12.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bring in besides</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα δ᾽ ἂν
				ἐφευρίσκῃ [τὰ τέλη</span>] <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				4.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>find out, invent</i>, of arts, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχναν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				12.7
			</span></i> (
				Med.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆτιν -ευρομένοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.262
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφῶς ἐφεῦρες ὥστε μὴ θανεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					699
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>find out, discover</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφεῦρε δ᾽ ἄστρων μέτρα καὶ
					περιστροφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					432.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνου διατριβάς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				479
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				140
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴδιόν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euphro
					1.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁσίαν ἐπίνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					799.5
				</span></i>
			 (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
